{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓星宋慧喬於2023年憑復仇劇《黑暗榮耀》首奪《百想藝術大賞》視后，她相隔3年再戰韓劇界，夥拍孔劉合演製作費高達800億韓圜（約4.67億港元）的重頭劇《夢響年代》，將於下月11日登陸串流平台，合共22集，第一部分（首8集）於下月11日播出</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T04:55:58.721217+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:48:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T04:49:18.109405+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T04:49:18.109405+00:00","content_hash":"fa3fff024d5e5e3e276fc0cb0efbb4fc93fc044b455768ed66a1aaa2c656b4cf","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}